whykey (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Observe first: listen tries native capture, then a probe window (Wayland or X11), then the terminal; an X11 grab probe detects grabbing window managers and hotkey daemons.
  * Ask running programs: i3 get_config fixed, GNOME gsettings, KDE kglobalaccel; zsh and fish adapters rewritten against real shells.
  * Reports carry evidence tiers; claims are verified in a Docker lab against real programs.

 -- Agustín Rojas <agustinrojas1@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:00:00 -0300

